BENIGNO S. AQUINO III
PLATFORM OF GOVERNMENT
A NATIONAL LEADERSHIP IN NEED OF TRANSFORMATIONAL
CHANGE Its legitimacy is under question;
It persecutes those who expose the truth about its illegitimacy and
corruption; It stays in power by corrupting individuals and institutions;
It confuses the people with half-truths and outright lies;
It rewards, rather than punishes, wrongdoing;
It offers no lasting solutions for the many problems of the country;
It weakens the democratic institutions that hold our leaders accountable. It hinders our local governments from delivering basic services;
It has no vision of governance beyond political survival and self-enrichment.
